Z||000027||FieroLisa||12-08-2000||11:09 AM||||Not real sure how fast I've gone. I had the GT to 100 on the way home from Louisiana, but the coupe, no clue. I was chasing someone down (another Fiero) on the way to the Carlisle show (long story dont ask) and when he finally stopped he said he was doing 120 (and my coupe was keeping up) but I don't even think a coupe (with no mods) can go that fast...so maybe 115? I don't know, it was scary as hell, that's for sure  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> .<BR><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (For Sale)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>*Updated Website* <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/</A> ||||reg||1
