Z||000053||RedOktober||12-12-2000||04:17 AM||||Fast enough to land in jail for the night, get my drivers license suspended for a year, Pay a 580 fine, and get probation for 2 years.<P>on top of all that, I had a wreckless driving charge on my driving record and have to buy special insurance to drive in the state of Wahington.<P>All in my 87 GT 5 Speed... But Osiffer..I'm not driving fast.. I'm flying LOW!!! <P>That was a few years ago...Lately, only 320KM ( thats about 200MPH ) in a highly moded Gen III RX-7 TT with 22psi boost. 450HP @ the wheels on the dino.<BR>Wasn't caught this time   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>86 SE V6 Auto Turbo Going 3.4 OHV "Red Oktober"<BR>86 2M4 5sp (Beater) "Blackie"<BR>87 GT "Blue Flame"<p>[This message has been edited by RedOktober (edited 12-12-2000).]||||reg||1
